OL,3,GNEWSAThird murder charge over Brent
OL,4,ACouncil HQ stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of three people have now been
OL,7,Fcharged with murder over the fatal
OL,8,Fstabbing of a 17-year-old boy at Brent
OL,9,FCivic Centre in Wembley.
OL,11,FDavid Wynter died after he was attacked
OL,12,Fon Engineers Way at about 14:30 BST on
OL,13,F25 August.
OL,15,FA 15-year-old boy was charged with
OL,16,Fmurder two days later, and two more
OL,17,Fteenagers - a 17-year-old boy and
OL,18,F18-year-old Jahquarn St Hillaire - were
OL,19,Fcharged with murder and possession of
OL,20,Fan offensive weapon on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
